        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-322877"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://odysseylogistics.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=63c0150c50b9490924dcf316" class="user-hover" rel="63c0150c50b9490924dcf316" data-account-id="63c0150c50b9490924dcf316" accountid="63c0150c50b9490924dcf316" rel="noreferrer">Adam Shingle</a> <a href="https://odysseylogistics.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A5d1c7dfc-e6eb-4f7a-a39b-cab8bf56d4d6" class="user-hover" rel="712020:5d1c7dfc-e6eb-4f7a-a39b-cab8bf56d4d6" data-account-id="712020:5d1c7dfc-e6eb-4f7a-a39b-cab8bf56d4d6" accountid="712020:5d1c7dfc-e6eb-4f7a-a39b-cab8bf56d4d6" rel="noreferrer">Laurie Blumsack</a> : This story has been reviewed by Dave. And, story is good but we need some clarification. So, I have put the story as blocked.</p>

<p><a href="https://odysseylogistics.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A03aa3c7b-ea4a-46af-9e43-b286e289791e" class="user-hover" rel="712020:03aa3c7b-ea4a-46af-9e43-b286e289791e" data-account-id="712020:03aa3c7b-ea4a-46af-9e43-b286e289791e" accountid="712020:03aa3c7b-ea4a-46af-9e43-b286e289791e" rel="noreferrer">Dave Schultz</a> : It would be great if you clarify the following points.</p>

<ol>
	<li>How we will handle when partial success when communication method is EDI and EMAIL?</li>
	<li>Do we even need Review Page in case of “EDI and EMAIL” communication method? Since, Accept and Decline button should not be there in this scenario, so is there any point in having the review page concept?</li>
